{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/Abouthisgame.png?t=1741980373\" /><br><br>When a group of shipwreck survivors wash up on the shores of a strange quiet island, the last thing they expected was a miracle. With no supplies and no idea where to get food, the settlers begin searching for help before stumbling across a sleeping stone automaton. When one brave settler takes a closer look, the stone giant awakens and offers to help the villagers build a home. <br><br>Cobble: The Stone Forager is an adventure resource-gathering game where you play as the friendly stone giant, Cobble. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/Gamefeatures.png?t=1741980373\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Help the shipwrecked settlers build up their town by gathering and foraging for supplies. <br></li><li>Unlock new areas and trade with the settlers to get stronger materials. <br></li><li>Rediscover the story of Cobble's creator and rebuild what has been lost.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/Aboutdevelopment.png?t=1741980373\" /><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Build All Bridges","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386700/97c443f4381d611e59b7facc374952d15dd3e58d.jpg"},{"name":"Farm Built","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386700/365489873f9095b9dc67952e6259ae6a43797bac.jpg"},{"name":"House Built","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386700/b20ead45d6fd37c3db3cec75e7c97813ea2b2f15.jpg"},{"name":"Sawmill Built"